# Career economy roadmap

Ship realism in **measurable slices**. Avoid opaque full-economy redesigns.

## Done (near-term economy loop)

- Fatia 1: regional NPC bid capacity → pay + bidChance.
- Fatia 2: lane saturation / soft fill shadow → urgency, lot caps, scarce pay.
- UI chips: thin fleet / lane busy (+ weather tags).
- Simulated regional weather (`fair|marginal|poor` per region per sim-day). No per-NPC METAR.
- Lot prune: `pruneDeadLots` drops `expired`/`delivered` after 48 ticks (~12h at 15-min batches; tick + migrate/load). Logbook untouched.
- Player inbound soft-shadow: accept/depart publishes `inboundPending`; soft fill / lane sat = NPC + player.
- Hub tiers (`major`/`regional`/`spoke`): curated offline from BR cargo roles; capacity/flow scale + lane lot caps; formLots ranks by absolute kg.
- Brazil map: 62 hubs across BR-N / BR-NE / BR-CO / BR-SE / BR-S (catalog `career-br-hubs.ts`; Manaus major, Brasília redistributor; +2 soft-field bush with official ICAO).
- **Soft-field bush hubs + unified bush trips:** `bush` flag on BR/US/CA/MX hubs (ferry blocked, light_ga). Market freights no longer form on bush ODs — payload rides on **bush trip** arcs ([`career-bush-trips.ts`](packages/shared/src/career-bush-trips.ts)): BR round-trip or US Activities **one-way** tours, `msfsValidated` gate. US PLNs: `K****` as normal spokes (+20); FAA locals as `bushTripOnly` (+32) — trip endpoints/map only (no Market/ferry/home). Freights → **Bush trips** board: accept/abandon + route map ([`career-bush-mission.ts`](packages/shared/src/career-bush-mission.ts)); fly/settle = later.
- Cargo corridors: curated OD weights bias `formLots` formation + mild pay; BR+US auto feeders (≥2 partners/hub); legacy saves gain missing hubs via `ensureCareerHubCoverage`.
- Idle-lot escalation: available lots raise pay from `basePayUsd` after 25% of life (cap +40%); flip urgent late; Market shows Idle +N% chip.
- Demand shocks: regional events (harvest/outage/congestion/festival/strike) affect prod/cons + freight pay/urgency/life; Market banner + lot chips.
- Fuel road logistics: background tanker fleet (60 trucks, ≤32 t) redistributes Jet-A hub→spoke; Terminal Fuel logistics block. US has 9 Jet-A production hubs (KMIA/KATL/KJFK/KORD/KIAH/KDFW/KDEN/KLAX/KSEA); BR densified to ~20 producers.
- Hub level 1→5: sticky XP from traffic (lots/settles/fuel/trucks); real capacity/flow/lane/pay/NPC-bid impact; soft quiet penalty without demotion.
- Aircraft market: Skyline-priced new/used/lease board with class caps/scarcity, abstract NPC demand (0–2/day), sell→relist, list spare for lease / leased_out income; free acquire removed (starter Caravan only).
- Aircraft wear/MX: AF+eng condition %, wear per block hour, workshop inspection gate + optional repair (MSRP-calibrated); no annual/TBO yet.
- Hangar parking fees: daily debit for parked/maintenance airframes (class × hub tier); assigned/leased_out/listed exempt.
- Company cashflow ledger: signed wallet movements + Hangar Cashflow (week / month / all-time).
- **Embedded SQLite persistence** via Node `node:sqlite` (`DatabaseSync`) behind `openCareerStore` (`profiles/career/skyline.sqlite`); one-shot JSON migrate; ledger table materialized. Tick still in-memory.
- **Partition contract:** `homeCountryId` / `countryIdFromRegion` (`BR-SE` → `BR`); domestic lot formation per country.
- **US continental medium map:** 6 regions (NE/SE/MW/SC/MT/W), 24 US hubs, sparse BR↔US intl lanes, NPC fleet 44, fuel trucks 20; resilient regional corridors (≥2 gateways per US regional), critical-full domestic overflow valve, and near-full production throttle; Market `intl` chip; health/market expose `countries` + `internationalLaneCount`.
- **Lots table (schema v2):** `lots` dual-written with `economy_json` on `saveEconomy`; hydrate overlay on load when table non-empty; real meta upgrade 1→2. Tick/missions still in-memory.
- **Schema v3:** lots are SoT (stripped from `economy_json`); `companies`/`company_state`/`fleet_aircraft`/`missions` + `inbound_pending`/`npc_flights`/`economy_events`; ledger has `company_id` (`local` for SP). Tick still in-memory behind `CareerStore`.
- **Schema v4:** world tables are SoT — `worlds` + `economy_meta` + `airports` + `airport_stock` keyed by `world_id` (`local` in SP); hubs/stock stripped from `economy_json`; terminal Inventory is `GET /api/airport?part=stock` (SQL, no career lock); full `/api/airport` still hydrates lots/NPC behind the lock. Tick still in-memory. MP shape: companies belong to a world; lots may carry `claimed_by_company_id`.
- **Schema v5:** world ops tables are SoT — `npcs`, `fuel_trucks`, `fuel_hauls`, `demand_orders`, `port_listings`, `port_inventories`, `port_concessions` keyed by `world_id`; stripped from `economy_json`. Tick still in-memory. Player WH / concessions stay on `company_state` (tenant).
- **Map expansion playbook:** `.cursor/rules/career-map-expansion.mdc` — checklist when adding airports/regions (seed constants + auto coverage on migrate).
- **15-min economy ticks:** `MS_PER_TICK = 900_000`, `TICKS_PER_DAY = 96`; physics (flight/rest/MX/fuel) uses `MS_PER_HOUR`; per-tick flows ÷4 and tick lifetimes ×4 so a career day stays ~24h wall-clock. Old saves need Reset world (no tick-scale migrate).
- **NPC airframe variants:** curated ICAO types from FSLTL traffic `flight_model.cfg` scrape (A321F, MD11F, 208B, …) — label + optional cargo ceiling only; not player OFP flight models. Legacy fleets backfill via `ensureNpcAirframes`.
- **NPC ops cargo clamp:** bids use route fuel/MTOW payload (not class maxRange alone); crew offers only when a homologated airframe has lift&gt;0; unflyable awaiting_pilot promotes early and hides Fly.
